  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:42.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-33.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;(注)１　取締役岡根幸宏は、社外取締役であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:42.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-33.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;　  ２　監査役調尚孝、立松哲二は、社外監査役であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;３　取締役の任期は、2023年６月28日開催の定時株主総会の終結の時から２年間であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row4Member">&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;４　当社は、会社法第329条第３項に定める補欠社外取締役１名を選任しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:42.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;補欠社外取締役の略歴は次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:51.5pt;"&gt;
